Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AVRp8mDpV9jS7UpPk2uhfF
(cherry picked from commit 3e58647066206e64beafc62a240e63202bc514bd)
