From a28cf4b379d1f233fafe8f776b29c5ccaf8752cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:05:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] zink: link xmlconfig through driver_zink

The first GCC build of Zink from this tree on Renga (GCC 15.3) compiled
all 942 steps and failed only at the final link of libEGL_mesa.so:

  zink_screen.c:3537: undefined reference to `driParseConfigFiles'
  zink_screen.c:3539: undefined reference to `driQueryOptionb'

zink_internal_create_screen() reads driconf options, but libzink does
not declare the dependency. On the DRI platforms the frontend brings
libxmlconfig in (src/egl/meson.build adds idep_xmlconfig only in its DRI
branch). Haiku's EGL driver links Zink directly, without a DRI frontend.
Add idep_xmlconfig to driver_zink, so every user of Zink links what Zink
calls.

Not yet built on Renga.

Generated-by: LLM
Biblioklept: this commit message was written by an AI model.
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AVRp8mDpV9jS7UpPk2uhfF
(cherry picked from commit c7aca8ab7dc7c56ab476941e46f54d95bc036d22)
---
 src/gallium/drivers/zink/meson.build | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/zink/meson.build b/src/gallium/drivers/zink/meson.build
index 34a4dc5..61e354f 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/zink/meson.build
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/zink/meson.build
@@ -118,6 +118,10 @@ driver_zink = declare_dependency(
   compile_args : '-DGALLIUM_ZINK',
   link_with : zink_deps,
   link_args : zink_link_args,
+  # zink_screen.c reads driconf (driParseConfigFiles, driQueryOptionb).
+  # Other loaders link xmlconfig through the DRI frontend; Haiku's EGL
+  # driver links Zink without one.
+  dependencies : idep_xmlconfig,
 )
 
 if with_tests
-- 
